ody. Its body’s heat can top 1,100 degrees F.",[21]="It’s small, but its body temperature is over 1,100 degrees F. Embers escape its mouth and nose when it breathes.",[22]="It’s small, but its body temperature is over 1,100 degrees F. Embers escape its mouth and nose when it breathes.",[23]="It’s small, but its body temperature is over 1,100 degrees Fahrenheit. Embers escape its mouth and nose when it breathes.",[24]="Its magma-like blood circulates throughout its body. Its body’s heat can top 1,100 degrees Fahrenheit.",[25]="Magby’s state of health is determined by observing the fire it breathes. If the Pokémon is spouting yellow flames from its mouth, it is in good health. When it is fatigued, black smoke will be mixed in with the flames.",[26]="Magby’s state of health is determined by observing the fire it breathes. If the Pokémon is spouting yellow flames from its mouth, it is in good health. When it is fatigued, black smoke will be mixed in with the flames.",[27]="Many of these Pokémon can be seen in areas with volcanic activity. Feeding can get them so excited, they exhale flames of 1,100 degrees F.",[28]="A famous potter lives with a Magby. Apparently its soft flames produce fine works.",[29]="When flames drip from its nose, that means it has a cold. Have it lie down for a nice rest in some magma.",[30]="Its body temperature is always around 1,100 degrees Fahrenheit. If Magby falls into a small-enough pond, the whole thing will dry up.",[33]="This Pokémon is still small and timid. Whenever Magby gets excited or surprised, flames leak from its mouth and its nose.",[34]="This Pokémon makes its home near volcanoes. At the end of the day, Magby soaks in magma, resting and recovering from the day’s fatigue.",[39]="This Pokémon lives in volcanic areas. With each breath, sparks spurt from its mouth and nose. When Magby is in good health, its flames gain a yellow tint."},es={[23]="Es pequeño, pero su cuerpo puede llegar a alcanzar 600 °C. Cuando inspira y espira, expulsa llamas por la nariz y por la boca.",[24]="Su sangre es como magma y su temperatura corporal puede alcanzar los 600 °C.",[25]="El estado de salud de Magby se puede determinar observando el fuego que emana al respirar. Si las llamas que echa por la boca son amarillas, está bien. Pero, si además de las llamas sale humo negro, está cansado.",[26]="El estado de salud de Magby se puede determinar observando el fuego que emana al respirar. Si las llamas que echa por la boca son amarillas, está bien. Pero, si además de las llamas sale humo negro, está cansado.",[27]="Es fácil encontrarse con un Magby en áreas cercanas a volcanes. Si se le da comida, se emociona y expulsa fuego a 600 °C.",[28]="Hay reputados alfareros que viven con Magby. Al parecer, sus suaves llamas son ideales para cocer grandes obras de alfarería.",[29]="Cuando se le escapan pequeñas llamaradas por el hocico significa que está resfriado y el mejor remedio es un buen baño de magma.",[30]="Su temperatura corporal ronda los 600 °C. Si cae en un pequeño estanque, es capaz de evaporarlo por completo.",[33]="Como todavía es pequeño, se asusta fácilmente. Cuando se emociona o se sorprende, se le escapa fuego por la nariz y por la boca.",[34]="Vive en los alrededores de los volcanes. Al final del día, se baña en magma para aliviar el cansancio."},pt="Este Pokémon vive em áreas vulcânicas. A cada respiração, faíscas saem da boca e do nariz. Quando Magby está com boa saúde, suas chamas ficam amareladas."},evo={{s=240},{s=126,from=240,c={{t="level-up",lv=30}}},{s=467,from=126,c={{t="trade",held=300}}}},moves={[3]={1,52,7,43,13,123,19,7,25,108,31,241,37,53,43,109,49,126},[4]={1,52,7,43,13,123,19,7,25,108,31,241,37,53,43,109,49,126},[5]={1,52,7,43,13,123,19,7,25,108,31,241,37,53,43,109,49,126},[6]={1,52,7,43,13,123,19,7,25,108,31,241,37,53,43,109,49,126},[7]={1,52,7,43,13,123,19,7,25,108,31,241,37,53,43,109,49,126},[8]={1,123,1,43,7,52,10,108,16,185,19,83,25,109,28,7,34,436,37,53,43,241,46,126},[9]={1,123,1,43,7